{"id":"longest-common-subsequence","title":"Longest Common Subsequence","topic":"15-dp","difficulty":"medium","points":20,"lc":1143,"tags":["dp","string"],"statement":{"hi":"Do strings `text1` aur `text2` di hain. Unki **longest common subsequence** ki length return karo. Agar koi common subsequence nahi hai to `0` return karo.","en":"Given two strings `text1` and `text2`, return the length of their **longest common subsequence**. If there is no common subsequence, return `0`."},"constraints":["1 ≤ text1.length, text2.length ≤ 1000","Both strings contain only lowercase English letters"],"hints":{"hi":["dp[i][j] = `text1` ke pehle i aur `text2` ke pehle j characters ka LCS.","Characters match ho to dp[i-1][j-1] + 1, warna max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])."],"en":["dp[i][j] = LCS of the first i chars of `text1` and the first j chars of `text2`.","If the characters match, dp[i-1][j-1] + 1; otherwise max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])."]},"signature":{"fn":"longestCommonSubsequence","params":[{"name":"text1","type":"string"},{"name":"text2","type":"string"}],"ret":"int"},"compare":"exact","starter":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int longestCommonSubsequence(string& text1, string& text2) {\n        \n    }\n};\n","examples":[{"args":["abcde","ace"],"expected":3,"explain":{"hi":"LCS \"ace\" hai, length 3.","en":"The LCS is \"ace\", length 3."}},{"args":["abc","abc"],"expected":3},{"args":["abc","def"],"expected":0}],"tests":[{"args":["abcde","ace"],"expected":3},{"args":["abc","abc"],"expected":3},{"args":["abc","def"],"expected":0},{"args":["a","a"],"expected":1},{"args":["a","b"],"expected":0},{"args":["aaaa","aa"],"expected":2},{"args":["abcba","abcbcba"],"expected":5},{"args":["bsbininm","jmjkbkjkv"],"expected":1},{"args":["","abaabaabaabaababababaaaaababbaabbbbaaaababbaabbbaaababbabaababbbababababaabaaaabbbaaabbababbaba"],"expected":95},{"args":["ed","ceacddecf"],"expected":2},{"args":["","yfykrbdvxhfdqtchqtfpddkshyrwnidvnzbwgsmkpwefnywgwlcxfgutsyzgdirsaekbkwwfzvyryxxadxmuuygldufcbygcvhhrfkrshkbiigfllbyqhgvrctpfgtpfpaevtgqrdoicbghmzavxnzxgauuhgjtryvtlnanyeeauqbhnfauhxqtikk"],"expected":115},{"args":["",""],"expected":424},{"args":["aacc","baacbbcc"],"expected":4},{"args":["",""],"expected":247},{"args":["vusxywdbtdsiwagdsuexfdpwqiqcizzkuisldvjjzyogocepbtsehsavszbgqqbzrdkalmjlhzmyienztewiudymsjzfhimnsczlkvhkpwonewodlblwjeycqiowecysbocvrtyggjjaqhkankabgraenypwsspdyniwtgtxhmxhwxssljlshixhiowcmowzmqtenwmlmdvyzzfxnsxepwwuywnhcoowyombnfsvfmwbyhyzuqjxkyfezppzfzldltmgvechephku","tlwuktwafsmvsaaosexqymcbbtwmnohobeivnnijewqnhssopyhokjwbuaxsjjlwifysbqrakugvivxqdhpnzwglrimojgbzzkuzdixtnbadquhgcpvqyeoqxpofqedinnu"],"expected":58},{"args":["f","dddefcaaab"],"expected":1},{"args":["",""],"expected":252},{"args":["","acddebdbbceeadafdaefbfcfbccafaceebdafaacfbbfbbebfbdbfccdfdebffaebbddecbbfcdbbdfededcfcabcbcabcecacdccbabdeffadabdbeefaebfbbffdcceaaecceadbbabecfcebdabbffbdfdbfefcbdb"],"expected":165},{"args":["unpkxkhnqq","czzqziyzla"],"expected":1},{"args":["lwbkwdgdcewiuuagqmdtlyspwtp",""],"expected":24},{"args":["",""],"expected":485},{"args":["acdbb","f"],"expected":0},{"args":["baabbbabbbbabbaabababababbbaabbbaaaabbbbbaababbababaabba","bbbb"],"expected":4},{"args":["",""],"expected":581},{"args":["suvsg","tpddlfbu"],"expected":1},{"args":["",""],"expected":452},{"args":["",""],"expected":267},{"args":["bb","cacacccaa"],"expected":0},{"args":["","abbabaabaabbababaabbabaaabbbabaaaaabbbbaaabaababababbaaaabaaabaabbaaaabaabbaaabbbaaaaaabbaaaababababaabbabbbbbaaaaaabbbabaabaaabaaaabaabbbbaabaabababbaaabbabbbaaaabbbbbaabbabbbbbbabbabbaabbababbbabaa"],"expected":199},{"args":["","cbabcbbaccacbcaabccccccacccbabbbcaacacbbcbbaabbcacbacccbaccbcbaccbbccabbbcbcabbacaabcaacbaabcaabbcbbcaa"],"expected":103},{"args":["baaabba","baab"],"expected":4},{"args":["",""],"expected":183},{"args":["","axleidnrrvdpeafgqdjjcullwpdtffcjupzrnewqjqvrdemjlkysngwlhrpnxnxxwxaeknsowrualnmitjcmhwpnhg"],"expected":70},{"args":["aaababaa","bbbbbbba"],"expected":3},{"args":["",""],"expected":395}],"solution":{"approach":{"hi":"2D DP: `dp[i][j]` = pehle i aur pehle j characters ka LCS. Last characters equal hon to diagonal + 1, warna upar/left ka max. Sirf pichhli row chahiye. O(m·n) time, O(n) space.","en":"2D DP: `dp[i][j]` = LCS of the first i and first j characters. If the last characters are equal, take the diagonal + 1, else the max of top/left. Only the previous row is needed. O(m·n) time, O(n) space."},"cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int longestCommonSubsequence(string& text1, string& text2) {\n        int n = text1.size(), m = text2.size();\n        vector<int> prev(m + 1, 0), cur(m + 1, 0);\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= m; j++)\n                cur[j] = text1[i - 1] == text2[j - 1] ? prev[j - 1] + 1 : max(prev[j], cur[j - 1]);\n            swap(prev, cur);\n        }\n        return prev[m];\n    }\n};"}}